hadiths[34]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1262","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har nasha lanay wali cheez khamr, sharaab, hai aur har khamr, sharaab, haraam hai. (Muslim: 6/101)"
"1263","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Badr ke din maal-e-ghaneemat mein aik oontni mili aur usi din aik oontni Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe khums mein se aur di. Phir jab main ne chaha ke Fatima-tuz-Zahra (raziyallahu anha) se shaadi karun jo ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sahabzadi thin to main ne Bani Qainuqa ke aik sunar se waada kiya ke wo mere saath chalay aur ham donon mil kar izkhir layein aur sunaron ke haath baichein aur us se main apni shaadi ka waleema karun. Main apni donon oontniyon ka samaan paalaan, rikaabein aur rassiyan waghera ikattha kar raha tha aur wo donon oontniyan aik Ansaari ki kothri ke baazu mein baithi thin. Jis waqt main ye samaan jo ikattha kar raha tha ikattha kar ke lauta to kya dekhta hun ke donon oontniyon ke kohaan katay hue aur un ke pehlu cheeray hue aur un ki kalaijiyan nikli hui hain. Main ne poocha ke ye kis ne kiya? Logon ne kaha ke Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib ne. Wo us ghar mein thay jahan kuch Ansaar sharaab pi rahay thay aur aik gaanay wali ga rahi thi. Us ne gaya: Ae Hamza! Moti taza oontniyon ke liye. To Hamza, nashay mein, utha aur talwaar le kar donon oontniyon ke kohaan kaat diye aur un ke pehlu cheer diye aur kalaijiyan nikaal lein. To main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gaya aur Aap ke saath Zaid bin Harisa thay. Aap ne is waqia ko suna to Aap apne jootay ghasettay hue bahar niklay. Hamza ke paas pahunchay aur usay malaamat ki. Hamza ne Aap ki taraf dekha aur kaha: Tum sab mere baap ke ghulam ho. Ye sun kar Aap peechay hatay aur bahar nikal aaye. Ye waqia sharaab ke haraam honay se pehle ka hai. (Muslim). (Shaarif se murad boorhi oontni hai; aqtaab paalaan hain.)"
"1264","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs Jaishan se aaya, aur Jaishan Yaman mein, aik sheher ka naam hai. Us ne Yaman ki us sharaab ke baaray mein poocha jo us ke mulk mein pi jati thi aur wo makayi se banayi jati thi aur us ko mizr kehtay thay. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us mein nasha hai? Us ne kaha haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo cheez nasha karay wo haraam hai. Aur Allah Taala ne waada kiya hai ke jo nasha piye us ko, aakhirat mein, Teenat-ul-Khabaal pilaye ga. Logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Teenat-ul-Khabaal kya hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye jahannamiyon ka paseena hai ya jism se nikalnay wala khoon aur peep. (Muslim: 6/100). Baab: Har nasha awar mashroob haraam hai."
"1265","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bita, aik qism ki, sharaab ke baaray mein poocha gaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har wo sharaab jis mein nasha ho, wo haraam hai. (Muslim: 6/99). Baab: Jo duniya mein sharaab piye wo aakhirat mein na piye ga magar tauba karay."
"1266","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs duniya mein sharaab piye, wo aakhirat mein na piye ga magar jab wo tauba kar le. (Muslim: 6/101). Baab: Khajoor aur angoor se sharaab."
"1267","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke sharaab un do darakhton se hoti hai, aik khajoor aur doosray angoor ke darakht se. (Muslim: 6/89). Baab: Adhoori aur pakki khajoor se sharaab."
"1268","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Talha, Abu Dujana, Muaz bin Jabal (raziyallahu anhuma) aur Ansaar ki aik jamaat ko sharaab pila raha tha ke itnay mein aik shakhs andar aaya aur kehnay laga: Aik nayi khabar hai ke sharaab haraam ho gayi hai. Phir ham ne usi din sharaab ko baha diya aur wo sharaab gadr, yani wo kachi khajoor jis ka rang surkh ya zard ho chuka ho lekin abhi khanay ke qaabil na ho, aur khushk khajoor ki thi. Qatada ne kaha ke Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab sharaab haraam hui to aksar sharaab un ki yehi thi khaleet yani gadr aur khushk khajoor ko mila kar, banayi hui. (Muslim: 6/88). Baab: Paanch cheezon se sharaab. (Busr se murad kachi khajoor hai.)"
"1269","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mimbar par khutba padhtay hue Allah Taala ki hamd o sana bayan ki phir kaha ke hamd o sana ke baad! Jaan rakho ke jab sharaab haraam hui thi to paanch cheezon se bana karti thi: Gandum, jau, khajoor, angoor aur shehed se. Aur sharaab wo hai jo aqal mein fatoor daalay, khwah kisi cheez ki ho. Is se Imam Abu Hanifa ka qaul radd ho gaya ke sharaab angoor se khaas hai kyunke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne mimbar par farmaya aur tamam sahaba ne qabool kiya, kisi ne aitraaz nahi kiya to goya ijma ho gaya. Ae logon! Meri khwahish thi ke kaash Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ham se teen cheezon ka, yani dada ke tarka ka, kalala ke tarkay ka aur sood ke chand abwaab ka, mufassal, bayan farma detay. (Muslim: 6/89)"
"1270","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor aur angoor ko ya pakki aur kachi khajoor ko mila kar nabeez bananay se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 6/90). (Ulama ne kaha sakht nashay ka sabab milana hai.)"
"1271","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo shakhs nabeed, khajoor ya angoor ka sharbat, piye to sirf angoor ka piye ya sirf khajoor ka ya sirf gadr khajoor ka, piye. (Muslim: 6/90). Baab: Kaddu aur roghni bartan mein nabeez se mumaniat."
"1272","[AI-translation] Zaazaan se riwayat hai, kehtay hain ke main ne Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke mujhe peenay ki cheezon mein se un cheezon ke mutaliq bataiye jin se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya hai. Apni lughat mein bata kar phir us ki hamari lughat mein wazahat kar dijiye kyunke Aap ki zubaan hamari zubaan se zara hat kar hai, to unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hantam yani thuliya se, dubba, kaddu ka bartan, muzaffat yani roghni bartan aur naqeer yani khajoor ki lakri ko kuraid kar banaye janay walay bartanon, mein nabeez bananay, se mana farmaya hai. Aur us baat ka hukm diya ke nabeez mashkon mein banaya jaye. (Muslim: 6/97). Baab: Pathar ke pyalay mein nabeez ki ijazat. (Tunsahu se murad chheelna hai; taur se murad bara pyala hai.)"
"1273","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye nabeez aik mashk mein banaya jata tha aur jab mashk na milti to pathar ke gharay mein banatay. Baaz ne kaha ke main ne Abu Zubair se suna wo kehtay thay ke ghara baraam yani pathar ka tha. (Muslim: 6/98). Baab: Sab bartanon mein nabeez ki rukhsat aur har nashay se mumaniat."
"1274","[AI-translation] Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein bartanon se mana kiya tha, lekin bartanon se koi cheez halaal ya haraam nahi hoti aur har nasha karnay wali cheez haraam hai. (Muslim: 6/98)"
"1275","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kuch bartanon mein nabeez bananay se mana farmaya to sahaba ne arz kiya ke tamam logon ko wo bartan mayassar nahi ho saktay jin mein nabeez bananay ki ijazat hai, chunanche Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne siwae muzaffat yani roghni matkay ke baaqi tamam bartanon mein nabeez bananay ki ijazat de di. (Muslim: 6/98-99). Baab: Nabeez ki muddat ka bayan."
"1276","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye awwal raat mein nabeez bhigo detay, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ko subah ko peetay, phir doosri raat ko, phir subah ko, phir teesri raat ko, phir subah se Asr tak. Us ke baad jo bachta to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khadim ko pila detay ya hukm detay wo baha diya jata. (Muslim: 6/101)"
"1277","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye aik mashk mein nabeez bhigotay aur gaanth laga detay. Us mein surakh tha. Subah ko ham bhigotay aur raat ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) peetay aur raat ko bhigotay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) subah ko peetay. (Muslim: 6/102). Baab: Sharaab ka sirka banana. (Yooka se murad gaanth lagana hai, azla se murad surakh hai.)"
"1278","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sharaab se sirka bananay ke mutaliq poocha gaya? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. (Muslim: 6/89). Baab: Sharaab se ilaaj."
"1279","[AI-translation] Wail Hazrami se riwayat hai ke Tariq bin Suwaid Jufi (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sharaab ke baaray mein poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke bananay se mana kiya, ya napasand kiya. Wo bola ke main dawa ke liye banata hun to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi wo dawa nahi balke beemari hai. (Muslim: 6/89). Baab: Bartan dhaanpnay ke baaray mein."
"1280","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Saidi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik pyala doodh ka, maqam, Naqi se laya, jo dhaanpa hua na tha to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu ne us ko dhaanpa kyun nahi? Agar dhaanpnay ko kuch na tha to, aik aari lakri hi us par rakh leta. Abu Humaid, rawi-e-hadees, kehtay hain ke hamein raat ke waqt mashkeezon ko baandhnay aur darwazay band karnay ka hukm farmaya. (Muslim: 6/105). (Naqi Madina ka maqam hai.)"
"1281","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat ho jaye ya farmaya ke tum shaam karo to apne bachon ko, gharon mein, rok lo kyunke us waqt shaitaan phail jatay hain. Phir jab kuch raat guzar jaye to bachon ko chhor do aur Allah ka naam le darwazay band kar do kyunke shaitaan band darwazay nahi kholta. Aur Allah ka naam le kar apne mashkeezon ka bandhan baandh do aur apne bartanon ko dhaank lo Allah ka naam le kar. Agar bartan dhaanknay ke liye aur kuch na milay siwa us ke ke, un bartanon ke upar koi cheez chaurayi mein rakho, to wohi rakh do, aur apne charaghon ko bujha do. (Muslim: 6/106)"
"1282","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bartan dhaanp do aur mashk band kar do, is liye ke saal mein aik raat aisi hoti hai jis mein waba utarti hai. Phir wo waba jo bartan khula paati hai ya mashk khuli paati hai, us mein utar jati hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Lais, rawi, ne kaha ke hamaray han Ajam mein Qanoon-e-Awwal, yani December, mein log us se bachtay hain. (Muslim: 6/107). Baab: Shehed, nabeez, doodh aur pani peena."
"1283","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne us pyalay se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko shehed, nabeez, pani aur doodh pilaya hai. (Muslim: 6/104). (Nabeez se murad ghair nashay wala sharbat hai; kusba se murad thori miqdaar hai.)"
"1284","[AI-translation] Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makka se Madina ko aaye to Suraqa bin Malik ne, mushrikon ki taraf se, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka peecha kiya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke liye baddua ki to us ka ghora, zameen mein, dhans gaya, yani zameen ne us ko pakar liya. Wo bola ke Aap mere liye dua kijiye main Aap ko nuqsan nahi pahunchaun ga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allah se dua ki, to us ko nijaat mili. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pyaas lagi aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bakriyon ke charwahay ke qareeb se guzray. Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main ne pyala liya aur thora sa doodh Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye doha aur le kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya, Aap (raziyallahu anhu) ne piya, yahan tak ke main khush ho gaya. (Muslim: 6/104)"
"1285","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jis raat Bait-ul-Maqdis ki sair karayi gayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas do pyalay laaye gaye. Aik mein sharaab thi aur aik mein doodh, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne donon ko dekha aur doodh ka pyala le liya. Jibrail (alaihissalam) ne kaha ke shukr hai us Allah ka jis ne Aap ko fitrat ki hidayat ki, yani Islam ki aur istiqamat ki. Agar Aap sharaab ko letay to Aap ki ummat gumrah ho jati. (Muslim: 6/104). Baab: Pyalay mein peena."
"1286","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay Arab ki aik aurat ka zikr hua to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Usaid ko usay paigham denay ka hukm diya, unhon ne paigham diya, wo aayi aur Bani Saida ke qilon mein utri, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklay aur us ke paas tashreef le gaye, jab wahan pahunchay to dekha ke aik aurat sar jhukaye hue hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se baat ki to wo boli ke main Allah Taala se tumhari panah maangti hun. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu ne mujh se apne aap ko bacha liya, yani ab main tujh se kuch nahi kahun ga. Logon ne us se kaha ke tu janti hai ke ye kaun shakhs hain? Us ne kaha ke nahi main nahi janti. Logon ne kaha ke Allah Taala ke Rasool hain, usay bara afsos hua aur wo apne ghar laut gayi. (Muslim). (Ujum se murad qila hai.)"
"1287","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mashkon ko ulta kar ke un ke munh se pani peenay se mana farmaya hai. Aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke mashk ko ulta karnay ka maqsad ye hai ke mashk ka munh neechay kar ke us se baraah-e-raast pani piya jaye. (Muslim: 6/110). Baab: Sonay chaandi ke bartanon mein peenay se mumaniat."
"1288","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ukaim kehtay hain ke ham Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Madain mein thay ke unhon ne pani maanga. Aik kisaan chaandi ke bartan mein pani le aaya to Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne bartan phaink diya aur farmaya ke main tumhein bata raha hun ke main ne us ko kaha tha ke mujhe chaandi ke bartan mein na pilana, kyunke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke sonay aur chaandi ke bartanon mein na piyo aur mota aur baareek resham na pehno, kyunke ye cheezein, kuffar, ke liye duniya mein aur ham, Musalmanon ke liye, aakhirat mein qayamat ke din hai. Jo shakhs chaandi ke bartanon mein peeta hai to wo yaqeenan apne pait mein jahannam ki aag daakhil karta hai. (Muslim: 6/136)"
"1289","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo chaandi ke bartanon mein peeta hai wo apne pait mein jahannam ki aag daakhil karta hai aur aik riwayat mein hai ke jo sonay aur chaandi ke bartanon mein khata peeta hai, wo apne pait mein jahannam ki aag daakhil karta hai. (Muslim: 6/134). Baab: Peetay waqt daayein wala zyada haqdaar hai."
"1290","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamaray ghar mein aaye aur pani maanga. Ham ne bakri ka doodh doha, phir us mein apne us kunwein se pani milaya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko diya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne piya aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baayein taraf baithay thay aur Umar (raziyallahu anhu) saamnay aur daayein taraf aik airaabi tha. Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sair ho kar pee liya to Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne, Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu), ki taraf ishara kartay hue kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) hain. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne, baaqi, airaabi ko diya aur Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ko nahi diya aur farmaya ke daayein taraf walay pehle haqdaar hain, daayein taraf walay pehle haqdaar hain, daayein taraf wala pehle haqdaar hai. (Muslim)"
"1291","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Saidi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas peenay ki koi cheez aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se piya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke daayein taraf aik larka tha aur baayein taraf baray log thay, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne larkay se farmaya ke tu mujh ko baray logon ko pehle denay ki ijazat deta hai? Wo bola ke nahi Allah ki qasam main apna hissa kisi doosray ko nahi dena chahta. Ye sun kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us larkay ke haath mein de diya. (Muslim: 6/113). Baab: Bartan mein saans lenay se mumaniat. (Tallah se murad rakh dena hai.)"
"1292","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bartan ke andar hi saans lenay se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 6/111). Baab: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sharbat mein teen saans letay thay."
"1293","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) peenay mein teen baar saans letay aur farmatay thay ke aisa karnay se khoob sairi hoti hai aur pyaas khoob bujhti hai ya beemari se tandrusti hoti hai aur pani achi tarah hazm hota hai. Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main bhi pani peenay mein teen baar saans leta hun. (Muslim: 6/111). Baab: Kharay ho kar peenay se mumaniat. (Abu Dawood ke alfaaz hain ke jab peetay to teen saans letay.)"
"1294","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi khara ho kar na piye aur jo bhoolay se pee le to qay kar daalay. (Muslim: 6/111). Baab: Zamzam kharay ho kar peenay ki rukhsat. (Umar bin Hamza zaeef hai, lekin sahih sanad se bhi yehi mazmoon hai baghair nisyaan ke.)"
"1295","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Zamzam ka pani pilaya, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kharay ho kar piya aur Kaaba ke paas pani talab farmaya. (Muslim: 6/111)"
